	"data": "Thoughtbubbles\n\nStatus: 214 journal mentions, data shape stabilized October 2024. Architecture: semantic web/RDF triple model.\n\nEvolution: Transitioning from standalone pre-XR Unity app to Room 2.0 module. Spatial knowledge graph rendered in AR anchors, navigable by walking through it.\n\nCritical Insight: Earlier prototypes lacked grounding; bubbles floating in void have no context. True value requires anchoring to physical reality (specific desk, Pi, room location) rather than floating in void,…",
